#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:5
#: 4671c2a914414b579de7c99193e1a786
msgid "Adding Support for a new MAVLink Gimbal"
msgstr "为新的 MAVLink 云台添加支持"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:7
#: 1311fab6929646ceb3d18335ecbdba14
msgid ""
"This page covers how ArduPilot interacts with a MAVLink enabled gimbal. It "
"is meant more as a guide on how gimbal manufacturers can make their gimbals "
"work with ArduPilot with minimum code changes to ArduPilot ."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍 ArduPilot 如何与支持 MAVLink 的云台进行交互。本文主要作为云台制造商的参考指南，说明如何以最少的 ArduPilot "
"代码改动，使其云台与 ArduPilot 兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:11
#: d7096ed2c16146c199c03a2748a0ee10
msgid ""
"The :ref:`SToRM32 gimbal <copter:common-storm32-gimbal>` is a good reference"
" as it supports MAVLink."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SToRM32 云台 <copter:common-storm32-gimbal>` 是一个很好的参考，因为它支持 MAVLink。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:15
#: 692c935419fb4ca8a6b06d2e1dcf4680
msgid "Messages the gimbal should support"
msgstr "云台应支持的消息"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:17
#: aa1f81957e7644fd9d1b0a456278ccaa
msgid ""
"The gimbal should listen on the serial port for a `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ message from the "
"vehicle. It can generally assume that the first heart beat it receives will "
"be from the vehicle but to be certain you can check the \"type\" field to be"
" sure it's something sensible (i.e. MAV_TYPE = 1 for fixed wing, 2 for "
"quadcopters but 6 for GCSs should be ignored)."
msgstr ""
"云台应在串口上监听来自飞行器的 `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ "
"消息。通常可以假定收到的第一个心跳包来自飞行器，但为确保无误，可检查 「type」 字段以确认其类型合理（即 MAV_TYPE = 1 表示固定翼，2 "
"表示四旋翼，而 6 表示地面站应予以忽略）。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:25
#: f11c02725a834273ae6741b30e0817cf
msgid ""
"This heart beat will contain the vehicle's system-id and component-id.  The "
"gimbal should adopt the same system-id but should use a component-id of "
"MAV_COMP_ID_GIMBAL (i.e. 154) for all its future messages.  In fact, any "
"unique component-id can be used as long as it's not zero nor the component "
"id of the vehicle or any other device on the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"该心跳包将包含飞行器的系统 ID 和组件 ID。云台应采用相同的系统 ID，但在所有后续消息中应使用 MAV_COMP_ID_GIMBAL（即 "
"154）作为组件 ID。实际上，只要不为零，也不与飞行器或其他设备的组件 ID 相同，任意唯一的组件 ID 均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:31
#: e342ff2459da4860b741007d7c83c1e4
msgid ""
"The gimbal should send a `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ message out the "
"serial port at approximately 1hz"
msgstr ""
"云台应以大约 1Hz 的频率通过串口发送 `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:35
#: 1c98a5df981f45889f3a07703ccc7bc8
msgid "the system-id and component-id should be as mentioned above."
msgstr "系统 ID 和组件 ID 应如上所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:36
#: 86e5e7e40b124d2b93de0265ce6f47c9
msgid "\"type\" should be MAV_TYPE_GIMBAL (i.e. 26)."
msgstr "「type」 应为 MAV_TYPE_GIMBAL（即 26）。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:37
#: 012e1b07284d4cc88f526f57f675c6b4
msgid ""
"\"autopilot\" is not used so can be set to anything including "
"MAV_AUTOPILOT_GENERIC (i.e. 0)"
msgstr "「autopilot」 字段未使用，可设为任意值，包括 MAV_AUTOPILOT_GENERIC（即 0）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:39
#: 19ba521237634f7080128c4510862864
msgid ""
"\"base_mode\" and \"custom_mode\" are not used so can be set to anything "
"(perhaps 0 is best)"
msgstr "「base_mode」 和 「custom_mode」 字段未使用，可设为任意值（建议设为 0）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:41
#: ae3ca794ad874937bfbc1ef6a8e85a36
msgid ""
"\"system_status\" should be set to \"MAV_STATE_ACTIVE\" once the gimbal is "
"ready to accept attitude targets"
msgstr "「system_status」 应在云台准备好接受姿态目标后设为 「MAV_STATE_ACTIVE」"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:44
#: f3ad2d65eaa94b7886293d53d60c8e54
msgid ""
"To support reading/writing parameter values from the ground station the "
"gimbal should implement these message:"
msgstr "为支持从地面站读取/写入参数值，云台应实现以下消息："

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:47
#: d919cb26d2b0408f8370449cbd00cb85
msgid ""
"`PARAM_REQUEST_READ "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_READ>`__ - if the "
"gimbal receives this message and \"target_system\" and \"target_component\" "
"values match the gimbal's system-id and component-id, it should respond with"
" a `PARAM_VALUE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ "
"message which contains the value of the parameter specified by the "
"\"param_id\" field (simply an enum, the gimbal can assign whatever enum it "
"wishes to each of its internal parameters)"
msgstr ""
"`PARAM_REQUEST_READ "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_READ>`__ —— "
"若云台收到此消息且 「target_system」 和 「target_component」 值与云台的系统 ID 和组件 ID 匹配，则应回复一条 "
"`PARAM_VALUE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ "
"消息，其中包含由 「param_id」 字段指定的参数值（param_id 仅为枚举值，云台可自行为其内部参数分配任意枚举值）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:55
#: 5a555f47b12e49549da7e01df6420e0b
msgid ""
"`PARAM_REQUEST_LIST "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_LIST>`__ - respond"
" to this message by sending a `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ message for "
"every parameter within the gimbal."
msgstr ""
"`PARAM_REQUEST_LIST "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_REQUEST_LIST>`__ —— "
"收到此消息后，应为云台内每个参数分别发送一条 `PARAM_VALUE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_VALUE>`__ 消息进行响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:59
#: 4b92bf9c3f5143ef9d7facc79f826d89
msgid ""
"`PARAM_SET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_SET>`__ - "
"respond to this by setting the internal variable to the value in the "
"\"param_value\" field."
msgstr ""
"`PARAM_SET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#PARAM_SET>`__ —— "
"收到此消息后，将内部变量设为 「param_value」 字段中的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:63
#: b0a16e7248ac4e1c82fba096da90daf2
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will send angle requests to the gimbal via MAVLink which will "
"arrive as `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ messages with "
"the \"command\" field set to MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL (i.e 205)."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将通过 MAVLink 向云台发送角度请求，以 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 消息的形式到达，其 "
"「command」 字段设为 MAV_CMD_DO_MOUNT_CONTROL（即 205）。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:69
#: a264c074e0db4b7cbd7c775248882b37
msgid "Param #1 contains desired pitch in degrees"
msgstr "Param #1 包含期望的俯仰角（度）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:70
#: 08c2c5c3dddc467a872f0fbcc32b4d4c
msgid "Param #2 contains desired roll in degrees"
msgstr "Param #2 包含期望的横滚角（度）"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:71
#: b972d1599a534d049a9ef195c3c11f45
msgid ""
"Param #3 contains desired yaw in degrees but note that the yaw is in "
"relation to the front of the vehicle so \"0\" is straight ahead, \"90\" is "
"to the right, \"-90\" is to the left."
msgstr "Param #3 包含期望的偏航角（度），注意偏航角相对于飞行器正前方，「0」 为正前方，「90」 为右侧，「-90」 为左侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:75
#: 0da38cbc642844ceb458f04cd24a8644
msgid ""
"If the gimbal needs extra data from the vehicle it can request it using the "
"`REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ message."
msgstr ""
"如果云台需要从飞行器获取额外数据，可使用 `REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ 消息进行请求。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:80
#: 12301bb78a9a4489acdf145aac2840d5
msgid "the target system and component id should be for the vehicle."
msgstr "目标系统和组件 ID 应为飞行器的对应值。"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:81
#: 9f009d0311b34f73a92a8926e0a0344f
msgid ""
"\"req_stream_id\" can be any values in the MAV_DATA_STREAM enum. Some useful"
" values are:"
msgstr "「req_stream_id」 可为 MAV_DATA_STREAM 枚举中的任意值。一些常用值包括："

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:84
#: 55026b300db84255a54f8fb41f3afc66
msgid ""
"MAV_DATA_STREAM_POSITION will cause the vehicle to send `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT"
" <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_POSITION_INT>`__ "
"messages which includes lat, lon, alt, velocity (3d) and heading)"
msgstr ""
"MAV_DATA_STREAM_POSITION 将使飞行器发送 `GLOBAL_POSITION_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_POSITION_INT>`__ "
"消息，其中包含纬度、经度、高度、速度（三维）和航向)"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:88
#: 0ad0886d159a4a80b169081f19202da0
msgid ""
"MAV_DATA_STREAM_EXTRA1 will send the `MSG_ATTITUDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE>`__ which includes "
"euler angles for roll, pitch, yaw"
msgstr ""
"MAV_DATA_STREAM_EXTRA1 将发送 `MSG_ATTITUDE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE>`__ 消息，其中包含横滚、俯仰、偏航的欧拉角"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:93
#: 79f8a0dbd71b4397865823f145f9fefb
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/code-overview-adding-support-for-a-new-mavlink-gimbal.rst:95
#: 3e0aa5aa27504cf393cd39f43a9623a4
msgid ""
"To test the system, you should be able to connect the gimbal to a Pixhawk as"
" if it's a SToRM32 gimbal. In particular check the `\"Set-up through the "
"Mission Planner (MALVink protocol)\" "
"<http://copter.ardupilot.com/wiki/common-storm32-gimbal/#set-"
"up_through_the_mission_planner_mavlink_protocol>`__ section."
msgstr ""
"要测试该系统，可以将云台连接到 Pixhawk，就像连接 SToRM32 云台一样。请特别参考 `「通过 Mission Planner "
"进行设置（MAVLink 协议）」 <http://copter.ardupilot.com/wiki/common-"
"storm32-gimbal/#set-up_through_the_mission_planner_mavlink_protocol>`__ 章节。"
